*> PLB-C093 pointer-too-small: a STRING or UNSTRING POINTER that
*> cannot hold one past the last position it counts.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PTRSMALL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-OUT              PIC X(20).
01  WS-IN               PIC X(99) VALUE "A,B,C".
01  WS-SHORT            PIC X(8).
01  WS-PART             PIC X(10) VALUE "PART".
01  WS-P                PIC 9.
01  WS-P2               PIC 99.
01  WS-P3               PIC S9(3) COMP-3.
01  WS-PB               PIC 9 COMP-5.
01  WS-FIELD            PIC X(5).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    *> Reported: 9 and 99 are below 21 and 100.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-P
    STRING WS-PART DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-OUT WITH POINTER WS-P
    MOVE 1 TO WS-P2
    UNSTRING WS-IN DELIMITED BY "," INTO WS-FIELD WITH POINTER WS-P2
    *> Not reported: room for 21; 9 for a receiver of 8; a binary
    *> pointer; reference modification.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-P2
    STRING WS-PART DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-OUT WITH POINTER WS-P2
    MOVE 1 TO WS-P3
    UNSTRING WS-IN DELIMITED BY "," INTO WS-FIELD WITH POINTER WS-P3
    MOVE 1 TO WS-P
    STRING WS-PART DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-SHORT WITH POINTER WS-P
    MOVE 1 TO WS-PB
    STRING WS-PART DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-OUT WITH POINTER WS-PB
    MOVE 1 TO WS-P
    STRING WS-PART DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-OUT(1:8) WITH POINTER WS-P
    DISPLAY WS-OUT WS-SHORT WS-FIELD
    STOP RUN.
